    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha=\\frac{12.5}{2.0}\"></span>   OR   6.25 «rad s<sup>−2</sup>» ✔ Allow the use of any point from the graph.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>ALTERNATIVE 1<br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 0.2\\times 0.4^{2}=0.016\"></span> ✔<br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Torque=lx\\alpha=\"></span>0.1 « Nm » ✔ <br/>ALTERNATIVE 2<br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta L=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 0.20\\times 0.40^{2}\\times 12.5=0.20\"></span> « Js » ✔<br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Γ=\\frac{\\Delta L}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}\\times 0.20\\times 0.40^{2}\\times 12.5}{2.0}=0.10\"></span> « Nm » ✔ Use of 6 gives an answer of 0.096 Nm. Allow ECF from MP1</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.i\"><p><strong>c.i</strong></p><p>initial momentum of block <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span> 0.016 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 12.5  OR  0.20 ✔ moment of inertia of the object is 0.10 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 0.40<sup>2</sup> ✔<br/><br/>conservation of angular momentum <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.20=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 0.20\\times 0.40^{2}+0.10\\times 0.40^{2}\\omega'\"></span> so <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega'=6.25\"></span> «rad s<sup>−1</sup>» ✔ Allow ECF for MP3 Allow ECF from b)</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c.ii\"><p><strong>c.ii</strong></p><p>initial KE is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\\times 0.20\\times 0.40^{2}\\times 12.5^{2}\"></span>  OR  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>1.25 « J » ✔<br/><br/>final KE is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\\times 0.20\\times 0.40^{2}\\times 6.25^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\times 0.10\\times 0.40^{2}\\times 6.25^{2}=0.625\"></span> « J » ✔<br/><br/>fraction lost is 50 % ✔ Allow ECF from c) i)<br/>Allow ECF for MP3</p></section>"
